<title>LATVIA: METALURGS, VALMIERA OFF, OTHERS STABLE ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>METALURGS, VALMIERA OFF, OTHERS STABLE ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
